<section class="saas-legal-page">
  <div class="saas-container saas-page-shell">
    <div class="saas-page-hero">
      <p class="saas-legal-kicker">Anime Avatar Stickers</p>

      <h1>Anime Avatar Sticker Generator</h1>

      <p>
        Create anime avatar stickers from character prompts or portrait ideas. Make profile-ready
        sticker art for creator icons, gaming profiles, chat reactions, and personal avatars.
      </p>
      <a class="saas-button saas-button-primary" href="/#generator">Create Anime Avatar</a>
    </div>

    <div class="saas-info-grid">
      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Character prompts</h2>

        <p>
          Describe the character, expression, color mood, and clean sticker framing for a readable
          anime avatar result.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Portrait direction</h2>

        <p>
          Upload a clear portrait and add anime avatar words when you want a profile-style sticker
          based on a real face.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Profile downloads</h2>

        <p>
          Save strong avatar results in history and download PNG for editing or WebP for smaller web
          and social assets.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>How to make an anime avatar sticker</h2>

      <ol>
        <li>Start with a portrait upload or write a character avatar prompt from scratch.</li>
        <li>Add anime-inspired style words, expression, clean outline, and simple background.</li>
        <li>Generate variations until the face, color, and framing work at small avatar size.</li>
        <li>Download PNG or WebP from history and reuse favorites for new variations.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Anime avatar prompt examples</h2>

      <div class="saas-prompt-list">
        <code>anime avatar sticker, cheerful face, clean outline, soft blue background</code>
        <code>gaming profile anime sticker, confident expression, bold border, neon accent</code>
        <code>
          creator anime avatar, friendly smile, rounded sticker style, simple background
        </code>
        <code>
          anime mascot reaction sticker, surprised face, crisp silhouette, bright colors
        </code>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Anime avatar sticker ideas</h2>

      <p>
        Anime avatar stickers work well for profile pictures, stream icons, creator branding,
        gaming communities, team mascots, and expressive chat stickers. Keep the face readable and
        the silhouette simple so the avatar still works when shown small.
      </p>

      <p>
        Use text prompts when you want a fictional character or mascot. Use portrait upload when you
        want a face-based starting point, then guide the style with anime avatar words.
      </p>

      <div class="saas-related-links">
        <.link navigate={~p"/ai-avatar-sticker"}>AI Avatar Sticker</.link>
        <.link navigate={~p"/kawaii-sticker-maker"}>Kawaii Sticker Maker</.link>
        <.link navigate={~p"/cute-sticker-ideas"}>Cute Sticker Ideas</.link>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="saas-faq">
      <details open>
        <summary>What is an anime avatar sticker?</summary>

        <p>
          It is a profile-style sticker with anime-inspired character styling, a readable expression,
          and clean sticker framing for avatars or chat use.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Can I create anime avatar stickers from text?</summary>

        <p>
          Yes. Text prompts work well for fictional avatars, creator icons, gaming profiles, team
          mascots, and reaction stickers.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Can I use a portrait for an anime avatar?</summary>

        <p>
          Yes. Upload a clear portrait and add an anime avatar prompt to guide the final sticker
          style.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
